Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:07.85,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.25,0:00:19.25,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:25.65,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now.\NSpirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:12.52,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.63,0:02:12.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is a restless ghost wandering in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.50,0:02:22.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The ghost is named Capitalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:30.70,Default,,400,0,550,,Fully \NAutomated \N Capitalism
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:54.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nonflammable recycling preparation is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.18,0:02:54.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:58.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:00.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't know why the Major is being so cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.94,0:03:04.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Our communications won't be tapped;\Nwe don't need to use secret codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:08.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we're not careful,\Nwe might be caught off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if the information was\Nwrong, gangsters are gangsters;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:15.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't see any way they could defeat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:19.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, what's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:24.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We finished closing the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:30.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major! There's an old man in the garbage\Nhere, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:32.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Leave him alone, that's the precinct’s job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:33.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:38.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've pulled out half of\Nthe weird car's plug wires.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:42.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Should I pull out this car's plug wires too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:47.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:55.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is indeed Japanese-made, very sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:04:00.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sanitation Department...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,we're here to collect bulky trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If it's a mistake,\NI'd like you to sign here please...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.78,0:04:34.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't move, and be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:42.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The authorities have already learned\Nof your plan to attack a financial institution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.35,0:04:44.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:54.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Didn't we tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:56.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,not to resist?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:18.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay, take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:29.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The information was right,\Nnothing worse than a shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:34.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We should wrap this case\Nup quickly and cautiously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:47.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:54.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're alive for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:06.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now is not the time to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:08.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, turn the car around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:09.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:15.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, there was one Senkousha android\Nmixed in with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:16.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:20.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The mastermind is a gangster\Nfrom the Henan Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.55,0:06:26.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,he wanted to get revenge for the money he\Nlost when Interstar sold its own stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.89,0:06:30.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You look terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:34.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is your goal to draw my gaze?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:36.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:38.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,there's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:42.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Was the information from the Henan Province\NDepartment of Public Safety useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are two things that I'm concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:49.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,One is the Android that was\Nthere but not in the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:53.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But that's not the big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:53.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:57.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The other is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:07:01.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,their goal should have been to\Nattack a financial institution,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:04.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so why did they have data\Non an individual investor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:09.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:11.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yokose Kanemoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:14.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He was originally a mathematician,\Nbut now he's one of the world's richest men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.69,0:07:19.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's a big investor who is involved\Nin every big speculative deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.99,0:07:22.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is to say, he's a corporate racketeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:25.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've heard his name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.69,0:07:28.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dealing with numbers wasn't\Nenough of a challenge for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:30.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so he started playing the stock market.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.49,0:07:31.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He seems to have a talent for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:36.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But he treats electronic money and\Nstocks as if they are just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:42.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,More than that, he seems to have a perverse obsession with collecting\Ngold, and he has amassed an enormous amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.89,0:07:48.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, he doesn't like publicity\Nand he rarely takes centre stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:50.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Therefore, he's called "Crow Tengu".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:53.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, he must have many enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:55.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Strange man, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:59.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You sure seem to know a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:00.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,are you buying stock now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:05.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I just happened to see a TV show\Ncalled "Luxurious Mansions of the World".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:09.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You sure are a family man...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:12.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, it's a transmission from Mr. Wan of the\NHuanan Province Public Safety Bureau.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:17.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmm, connect to it with double security measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.09,0:08:19.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.99,0:08:22.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Aramaki-San, it's been a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,since the Asia Public Safety Conference, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.09,0:08:27.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We apologise for the trouble in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:31.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This brings shame to our\Ncountry, I must apologise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:34.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, fortunately we handled it at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.89,0:08:36.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's happening today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:42.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Actually, after investigating the bank accounts of the\Npeople who smuggled weapons to the gangsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,we saw an unexplained transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:51.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From past experience, I think this is\Nevidence that they hired a mafia gunman,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:52.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so I wanted to let you know right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:55.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you for your trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:58.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will carefully plan how to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:00.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:05.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just to be sure, watch Yokose Kanemoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou will go to the heliport\Nwith Ishikawa and equip with D3.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:11.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Load up one Tachikoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:16.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa will re-interrogate the gangsters.\NUse whatever methods necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:28.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From A-SIA to ¥€$?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:33.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I believe the exchange rate for Yen\Nwould be more favorable...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:34.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:37.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just a moment please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:54.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa-San, let me play with it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:03.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:07.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can't find any contact information for Yokose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:08.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:12.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,File a legal brief and see which lawyers respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:13.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You should be able to find\Ninformation through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:18.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even major banks have corporate\Nofficers who are responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:22.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nope, that trick didn't catch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:25.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Actually, he's an enigma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:28.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Not only is he not cyberized,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.82,0:11:33.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,even his chief manager doesn't have his contact information,\Nneither on his mobile devices nor his computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:37.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about the producer of\Nthat luxurious mansions show?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:40.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He should know the contact information, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:42.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I tried that too,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:46.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but it seems like Yokose was the one\Nwho initiated all contact during the interviews.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:50.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So the big mansion is all you know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Turn on your optical camouflage and follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:10.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:14.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's with that answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.29,0:12:23.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, how is it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:27.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've arrived at the back of the mansion,\Nand it's crawling with bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:32.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, I've figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:34.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Only one hit man was hired after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:45.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Alias Fem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:49.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Fem is a battle cyborg who is a member of the\NNanHai Mafia and is wanted internationally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:54.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've confirmed it by tracing\Nback the back account,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:59.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it seems like the people from the Chinese restaurant\Nwere just trying to distract our investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:02.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, I'll see the rest on the report later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:03.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You fly over here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:04.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:08.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,*Sigh* Good thing I was already heading there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:16.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, North Port Maintenance has\Nan appointment at Yokose's mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:21.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've rewritten the appointment and the ID,\Nso you can go through the front entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.95,0:13:23.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger, you've done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:26.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stay there and watch over the mansion's systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:43.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Whoa... what bad taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:51.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Maybe I should take one home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:08.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.61,0:14:10.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here I go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:17.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.87,0:14:28.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bankers...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.87,0:14:30.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bad timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.93,0:14:38.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, check that van.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:47.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,May I have your name please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:51.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:56.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He seems to be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.78,0:14:58.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're a step behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.38,0:15:03.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you don't have an appointment,\Nwill you leave please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.68,0:15:07.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm from North Port Maintenance,\NI'm here to do the regular inspections.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.58,0:15:10.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you for always taking the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:20.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are there only dolls without ghosts here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:24.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, I've disabled the security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:26.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hurry in and protect Yokose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:28.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Fem has already snuck into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.58,0:15:31.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, I might be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:32.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:38.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,May I ask you who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:41.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, I'm Tachikoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.61,0:15:59.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here I go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:05.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They probably can't jump up here,\Nbut to kill them one by one would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.89,0:16:11.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Only that one is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.19,0:16:17.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll try this then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:42.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Suspicious-looking person detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.27,0:16:49.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What am I doing...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, what were you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.07,0:16:56.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, these androids don't have\Nbarriers protecting their brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.57,0:16:57.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now, the hit man is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:17:00.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You haven't forgotten your role\Nas my clothes, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:02.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I didn't mean to forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:23.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yokose-sama is sleeping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:26.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please wait until he's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:28.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I won't wake him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.79,0:18:01.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:04.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Boy, I finally understand dog's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:07.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Listen guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:08.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,SIT!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.17,0:18:14.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:16.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.17,0:18:18.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:27.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're surrounded by the gold you exploited\Nfrom the poor, you must be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:31.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yokose Kanemoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.95,0:18:34.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Die by the gold you love so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:35.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hold it right there, Fem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.65,0:18:38.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:40.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You'd better surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:50.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:07.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You should've shot Yokose first, shouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.86,0:19:09.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:11.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What have you been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:15.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You were slacking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:17.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A few things happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.36,0:19:20.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wow, this is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:22.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is quite the eye candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:24.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,More like poison for the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:28.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What kind of nerves do you have to not\Nhave been woken up by all this fuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:40.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He has been dead for at\Nleast three or four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.06,0:19:43.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here's some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:48.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that he programmed\Nwhat it should do if he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:54.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His money-making program has been working...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:57.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so nobody could tell that he was dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:20:01.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Seems like it, yeah. Now what about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:04.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It'd be bad if we didn't contact\Nhis lawyers and family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:06.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To tell them, 'Your boss is dead.'
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:09.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm afraid he doesn't have any family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:12.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I remember right,\Nhe said something like that in an interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:15.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That reminds me, you're familiar with Yokose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:17.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you take care of the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.76,0:20:18.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:20.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:31.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If there aren't any heirs,\Nthe government will take that bullion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:33.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's quite unreasonable isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:36.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Isn't it unreasonable to\Naccumulate so much for oneself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.19,0:20:38.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you holding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.11,0:20:46.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can't possibly take it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:57.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:08.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's a toll to cross the river Styx.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.91,0:21:19.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This money-making program\Nuses a huge amount of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.01,0:21:25.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It will be difficult to file a\Ndetailed report until we have the AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.11,0:21:27.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do it as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.21,0:21:29.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Say, how's the Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.31,0:21:33.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's talking with Ishikawa about our bad AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.41,0:21:35.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.31,0:21:40.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You have a point there, but can't you input\Ndata like discipline or an admonition?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.51,0:21:42.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:48.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but the Tachikomas can't even\Ncomprehend the concept of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.85,0:21:57.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:21:59.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.09,0:22:05.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Look, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.49,0:22:09.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I made 100,000 yen on Meditech's stock today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.59,0:22:11.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you really buy that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.39,0:22:13.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'd completely forgotten about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.89,0:22:14.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.09,0:22:17.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Financial management is an\Nimportant skill for housewives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.59,0:22:21.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dinner is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.38,0:22:45.38,Style,,0,0,320,,{\i1}Serrano Genomics{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.23,0:22:49.33,Style,,0,0,720,,- Purchase
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.23,0:22:49.33,Style,,0,0,190,,- Cancel
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.36,0:23:19.44,Default,,0,0,900,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:23.16,Default,,0,0,900,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:27.68,Default,,0,0,900,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.94,Default,,0,0,900,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.28,Default,,0,0,900,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:39.77,Default,,0,0,900,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:42.93,Default,,0,0,900,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:47.70,Default,,0,0,900,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.85,0:23:50.55,Default,,0,0,900,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:55.33,Default,,0,0,900,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.95,0:24:00.15,Default,,0,0,900,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.15,0:24:00.65,Default,,0,0,900,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.85,0:24:03.45,Default,,0,0,900,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.25,0:24:05.45,Default,,0,0,900,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:07.71,Default,,0,0,900,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:10.81,Default,,0,0,900,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:14.62,Default,,0,0,900,,When she wakes up
